      condition: \'eventKind == "DIVIDEND"\'
      expression: "grossIncome * 0.20"
    - name: "Chinese interest statutory non-treaty rate"
      expression: "grossIncome * 0.20"');
# Dividend and exceptional bond rates include the 5.5% solidarity surcharge on 25% withholding.
